#: src/Admin/AdminModule.php:446
msgid "LINE Login channel connected"
msgstr "已連接 LINE Login 頻道"

#: src/Admin/AdminModule.php:447
msgid "Add the Channel ID and Channel Secret from the LINE Developers Console."
msgstr "請從 LINE Developers Console 填入 Channel ID 與 Channel Secret。"

#: src/Admin/AdminModule.php:453
msgid "Messaging API channel connected"
msgstr "已連接 Messaging API 頻道"

#: src/Admin/AdminModule.php:454
msgid "The bot cannot send or receive anything until this is set."
msgstr "沒有設定這個，機器人無法收發任何訊息。"

