#: views/settings.php:596
msgid "Add a LINE tab where customers can link and unlink their account"
msgstr "新增一個 LINE 分頁，讓客人可以連結或解除連結帳號"

#: views/settings.php:597
msgid "Login buttons"
msgstr "登入按鈕"

#: views/settings.php:597
msgid "Offer LINE sign-in on the account and checkout pages"
msgstr "在帳戶頁與結帳頁提供 LINE 登入"

#: views/settings.php:598
msgid "Show customers a card with a QR code that staff can scan at the counter"
msgstr "讓顧客看到會員卡 QR Code，店員可以在櫃檯掃描"

#: views/settings.php:603
msgid "Counter lookup"
msgstr "櫃檯查詢"

#: views/settings.php:606
msgid "Staff scan a card with any phone camera. When the camera will not read it, they can type the code the customer reads out:"
msgstr "店員用任何手機相機掃描會員卡。掃不到的時候，可以請顧客念出代碼，在這裡輸入："

#: views/settings.php:614
msgid "Both pages are staff-only: anyone else who opens a card sees a sign-in prompt and nothing about the customer."
msgstr "這兩個頁面只有店員能看：其他人打開會員卡只會看到登入畫面，看不到顧客資料。"

#: views/settings.php:631
msgid "Those buttons are switched on but nothing is drawn yet: signing in with LINE needs the LINE Login channel, which has no credentials."
msgstr "這些按鈕是開啟的，但目前什麼都畫不出來：用 LINE 登入需要 LINE Login 頻道，而那邊還沒有填入憑證。"

#: views/settings.php:632
msgid "Fill them in"
msgstr "去填寫"

#. translators: %s: LINE Pay settings tab URL.
#: views/settings.php:647
#, php-format
msgid "LINE Pay is configured on the <a href=\"%s\">LINE Pay tab</a>, and the gateway is switched on under WooCommerce > Settings > Payments."
msgstr "LINE Pay 在 <a href=\"%s\">LINE Pay 分頁</a>設定，金流閘道則在 WooCommerce > 設定 > 付款 裡開啟。"

#: views/settings.php:658
msgid "Enable LINE Pay for WooCommerce and payment links"
msgstr "為 WooCommerce 與收款連結啟用 LINE Pay"

#: views/settings.php:659
msgid "Pay Channel ID"
msgstr "Pay Channel ID"

#: views/settings.php:659
msgid "From the LINE Pay merchant console, not the Developers Console."
msgstr "取自 LINE Pay 商家後台，不是 Developers Console。"

#: views/settings.php:660
msgid "Pay Channel secret"
msgstr "Pay Channel Secret"

#: views/settings.php:661
msgid "Use the sandbox environment (no real money moves)"
msgstr "使用沙盒環境（不會有實際金流）"

#: views/settings.php:664
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "幣別"

#: views/settings.php:666
msgid "Must match both your LINE Pay merchant currency and the WooCommerce store currency, or the gateway hides itself at checkout."
msgstr "必須同時符合 LINE Pay 商家幣別和 WooCommerce 商店幣別，否則結帳頁不會顯示這個金流。"

#: views/settings.php:668
msgid "Capture immediately"
msgstr "立即請款"

#: views/settings.php:668
msgid "Take the money as soon as the customer confirms"
msgstr "客人確認後立刻扣款"

#: views/settings.php:674
msgid "With immediate capture off, payments are only authorised. You then have to capture or void each one, and an order cancelled in WooCommerce releases its authorisation automatically."
msgstr "關閉立即請款時，付款只會被授權。之後你必須自己請款或作廢，而在 WooCommerce 取消訂單會自動釋放該筆授權。"

#: views/settings.php:684
msgid "Log level"
msgstr "紀錄等級"

#: views/settings.php:687
msgid "Notable events"
msgstr "值得注意的事件"

#: views/settings.php:690
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: views/settings.php:693
msgid "Keep logs for"
msgstr "紀錄保留"

#: views/settings.php:693
msgid "Days. Older rows are deleted daily."
msgstr "天。更舊的資料每天會被刪除。"

#: views/settings.php:694
msgid "Keep conversations for"
msgstr "對話保留"

#: views/settings.php:694
msgid "Days. Set to 0 to keep messages forever."
msgstr "天。填 0 代表永久保留訊息。"

#: views/settings.php:697
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "加密"

#: views/settings.php:701
msgid "Keys are derived from this site's WordPress salts, so a database dump alone cannot reveal them. Changing the salts in wp-config.php makes stored credentials unreadable and they will need re-entering."
msgstr "金鑰是從這個站台的 WordPress salt 推導出來的，所以光是資料庫備份無法解出。更改 wp-config.php 裡的 salt 會使已儲存的憑證無法讀取，屆時必須重新輸入。"

#: views/settings.php:703
msgid "Not available on this server"
msgstr "這台主機不支援"

#: views/settings.php:704
msgid "OpenSSL with AES-256-GCM is missing, so credentials are stored as plain text."
msgstr "缺少支援 AES-256-GCM 的 OpenSSL，因此憑證是以明文儲存。"

#: views/templates.php:23
